After CR-0008-T1: the package's BuildingDecor on the engine of CR-0008 (Route A of visual-v2/ADOPT.md, step 2). The store fill reads
the building's own store against CityQueries.TryGetEffectiveLimit (T1 removed the city's stock and TryGetEffectiveCap), and IsWorking
takes the city and covers the three new kinds: the science building while a research timer runs, a courier station while one of its
couriers walks, a warehouse while a trip goes to or from it or a courier walks to it; a construction site that waits for goods stands
still. Apply after adopt.sh: git apply visual-v2/after-cr0008.patch. Compiled against the T1 branch at 6029f17 (H1) with Unity stubs.

